name conversation_barge_in
describe User <-> AI conversation, audio, clean 100 ms RTT link; the user talks over the AI's reply and the AI stops (#754)
duration 30s
call two-way
video off
at 0s capacity=2500kbps delay=50ms queue=300ms
reverse at 0s capacity=2500kbps delay=50ms queue=300ms
turn user 1s-4s
turn ai after=800ms len=6s
barge-in at 7s len=2s
turn ai after=800ms len=3s
turn user 16s-19s
turn ai after=800ms len=4s
# program.md 6.3, conversation rows: barge-in stops the AI's audio (sev:1), within 500 ms at the user's ear on a
# 100 ms RTT link (sev:2), and the user hears every reply. On a clean link the AI detects each end of turn and the
# barge-in once and in time (#756).
expect conv.barge_ins == 1
expect conv.barge_in_stop_ms < 500
expect conv.responses == 3
expect conv.turn_detect_errors == 0
expect conv.response_delay_p95_ms < 500
